{"id":"vd-b1-the-food-truck","level":"b1","n":14,"title":{"en":"What I Liked Was…","vi":"Điều bà thích là…"},"summary":"Teta nếm thử món của hai cháu ngay bên chiếc xe màu cam và góp ý thẳng thắn nhưng khéo léo; Sami học cách nghe mà không cãi.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-food-truck","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Food Truck","vi":"Xe đồ ăn lưu động"}},"scene":{"background":"street","props":[{"id":"sandwich","x":820,"y":610,"scale":0.9}]},"cast":{"teta":{"name":{"en":"Teta","vi":"Teta"},"look":"grandma","x":520,"style":{"skin":"#C9936B","skinShade":"#B07A55","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#5E7D4E","topShade":"#4D683F"}},"sami":{"name":{"en":"Sami","vi":"Sami"},"look":"teenboy","x":1150,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#C9936B","skinShade":"#B07A55","outfit":"apron","top":"#F28C28","topShade":"#D9771C"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"sami","en":"So, Teta? Be honest. What do you think?","vi":"Sao ạ, Teta? Bà cứ nói thật. Bà thấy thế nào?","ipa":["soʊ","ˈtɛtə","bi","ˈɑnəst","wʌt","du","ju","θɪŋk"],"start":0.554,"end":3.564,"expression":"worried","prop":"sandwich","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.765],[2,1.678],[3,1.834],[4,2.798],[5,2.928],[6,3.006],[7,3.136]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"Do you want my honest feedback, or do you want me to be nice?","vi":"Cháu muốn bà góp ý thật lòng, hay muốn bà nói cho dễ nghe?","ipa":["du","ju","wɑnt","maɪ","ˈɑnəst","ˈfidˌbæk","ɔɹ","du","ju","wɑnt","mi","tu","bi","naɪs"],"start":4.354,"end":7.404,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,4.354],[1,4.371],[2,4.493],[3,4.683],[4,4.873],[5,5.267],[6,5.974],[7,6.11],[8,6.205],[9,6.3],[10,6.49],[11,6.612],[12,6.708],[13,6.857]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Honest. Please.","vi":"Thật lòng ạ. Bà nói đi.","ipa":["ˈɑnəst","pliz"],"start":8.194,"end":9.454,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,8.194],[1,9.051]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"All right. What I liked was the bread. It's soft and fresh.","vi":"Được. Điều bà thích là bánh mì. Mềm và tươi.","ipa":["ɔl","ɹaɪt","wʌt","aɪ","laɪkt","wɑz","ðə","bɹɛd","ɪts","sɑft","ənd","fɹɛʃ"],"start":10.244,"end":15.494,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,10.244],[1,10.369],[2,11.8],[3,12.018],[4,12.113],[5,12.48],[6,12.643],[7,12.765],[8,14.178],[9,14.409],[10,14.762],[11,14.885]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Thanks! We buy it every morning.","vi":"Cảm ơn bà! Sáng nào tụi cháu cũng mua.","ipa":["θæŋks","wi","baɪ","ɪt","ˈɛvɚi","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ"],"start":16.284,"end":18.574,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,16.284],[1,17.144],[2,17.274],[3,17.547],[4,17.743],[5,18.042]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"But the falafel is a bit dry. Maybe you could fry it at the last moment.","vi":"Nhưng bánh falafel hơi khô. Có lẽ cháu nên rán nó vào phút chót.","ipa":["bʌt","ðə","fəˈlɑfəl","ɪz","ə","bɪt","dɹaɪ","ˈmeɪbi","ju","kʊd","fɹaɪ","ɪt","æt","ðə","læst","ˈmoʊmənt"],"start":19.364,"end":24.134,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,19.364],[1,19.445],[2,19.54],[3,20.097],[4,20.247],[5,20.315],[6,20.532],[7,21.922],[8,22.262],[9,22.411],[10,22.574],[11,22.9],[12,23.009],[13,23.118],[14,23.226],[15,23.621]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"We cook it in the morning because we're so busy.","vi":"Tụi cháu nấu từ sáng vì bận quá ạ.","ipa":["wi","kʊk","ɪt","ɪn","ðə","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ","bɪˈkɔz","wiɹ","soʊ","ˈbɪzi"],"start":24.924,"end":27.374,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,24.924],[1,24.996],[2,25.257],[3,25.374],[4,25.504],[5,25.569],[6,26.09],[7,26.442],[8,26.598],[9,26.884]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"I understand. But it would be better if you cooked less, more often.","vi":"Bà hiểu. Nhưng sẽ tốt hơn nếu cháu nấu ít một, nhiều lần.","ipa":["aɪ","ˌʌndɚˈstænd","bʌt","ɪt","wʊd","bi","ˈbɛtɚ","ɪf","ju","kʊkt","lɛs","mɔɹ","ˈɔfən"],"start":28.164,"end":32.904,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,28.164],[1,28.272],[2,30.016],[3,30.192],[4,30.274],[5,30.41],[6,30.559],[7,30.926],[8,31.062],[9,31.198],[10,31.551],[11,32.081],[12,32.38]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Hmm. That makes sense.","vi":"Hừm. Nghe có lý ạ.","ipa":["hm","ðæt","meɪks","sɛns"],"start":33.694,"end":35.304,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,33.694],[1,34.31],[2,34.505],[3,34.779]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"And have you thought about making the menu shorter?","vi":"Và cháu đã nghĩ đến việc làm thực đơn ngắn lại chưa?","ipa":["ənd","hæv","ju","θɔt","əˈbaʊt","ˈmeɪkɪŋ","ðə","ˈmɛnju","ˈʃɔɹtɚ"],"start":36.094,"end":38.234,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,36.094],[1,36.179],[2,36.342],[3,36.477],[4,36.722],[5,36.994],[6,37.32],[7,37.429],[8,37.741]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Shorter? But customers like choice! Most of the complaints are about waiting, not the menu.","vi":"Ngắn lại ạ? Nhưng khách thích được lựa chọn mà! Phần lớn lời phàn nàn là về chuyện chờ lâu, đâu phải thực đơn.","ipa":["ˈʃɔɹtɚ","bʌt","ˈkʌstəmɚz","laɪk","tʃɔɪs","moʊst","ʌv","ðə","kəmˈpleɪnts","ɑɹ","əˈbaʊt","ˈweɪtɪŋ","nɑt","ðə","ˈmɛnju"],"start":39.024,"end":45.124,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,39.024],[1,39.95],[2,40.08],[3,40.705],[4,40.939],[5,41.955],[6,42.306],[7,42.398],[8,42.502],[9,43.127],[10,43.322],[11,43.674],[12,44.194],[13,44.533],[14,44.624]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"They like fast food more. Twelve dishes and two cooks is too many.","vi":"Họ thích được phục vụ nhanh hơn. Mười hai món mà hai đầu bếp là quá nhiều.","ipa":["ðeɪ","laɪk","fæst","fud","mɔɹ","twɛlv","ˈdɪʃəz","ənd","tu","kʊks","ɪz","tu","ˈmɛni"],"start":45.914,"end":50.664,"gesture":"shake","timing":[[0,45.914],[1,45.975],[2,46.274],[3,46.695],[4,46.967],[5,48.371],[6,48.71],[7,49.132],[8,49.281],[9,49.498],[10,49.892],[11,50.042],[12,50.232]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"So we should reduce it to… four dishes?","vi":"Vậy tụi cháu nên rút xuống còn… bốn món ạ?","ipa":["soʊ","wi","ʃʊd","ɹəˈdus","ɪt","tu","fɔɹ","ˈdɪʃəz"],"start":51.454,"end":54.014,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,51.454],[1,51.59],[2,51.708],[3,51.994],[4,52.424],[5,52.606],[6,53.257],[7,53.491]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"Four perfect dishes. Next time, try that for a week. If it's faster, you'll have a queue every lunchtime.","vi":"Bốn món thật hoàn hảo. Lần tới, cháu thử làm vậy một tuần xem. Nếu nhanh hơn, trưa nào cũng sẽ có khách xếp hàng.","ipa":["fɔɹ","pɚˈfɛkt","ˈdɪʃəz","nɛkst","taɪm","tɹaɪ","ðæt","fɔɹ","ə","wik","ɪf","ɪts","ˈfæstɚ","jul","hæv","ə","kju","ˈɛvɚi","ˈlʌntʃˌtaɪm"],"start":54.804,"end":63.084,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,54.804],[1,54.981],[2,55.456],[3,57.091],[4,57.485],[5,58.029],[6,58.273],[7,58.518],[8,58.694],[9,58.776],[10,60.189],[11,60.379],[12,60.583],[13,61.357],[14,61.534],[15,61.684],[16,61.765],[17,62.023],[18,62.322]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"OK. Anything else?","vi":"Vâng. Còn gì nữa không ạ?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ","ɛls"],"start":63.874,"end":65.304,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,63.874],[1,64.522],[2,64.887]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"One small suggestion. The sauce needs slightly more lemon.","vi":"Một góp ý nhỏ nữa. Nước sốt cần thêm một chút chanh.","ipa":["wʌn","smɔl","səˈdʒɛstʃən","ðə","sɔs","nidz","ˈslaɪtli","mɔɹ","ˈlɛmən"],"start":66.094,"end":70.434,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,66.094],[1,66.284],[2,66.583],[3,68.421],[4,68.584],[5,68.992],[6,69.25],[7,69.685],[8,69.943]]},{"speaker":"sami","en":"Thanks, Teta. That's really helpful. I'll try to improve everything.","vi":"Cảm ơn Teta. Góp ý của bà giúp cháu nhiều lắm. Cháu sẽ cố cải thiện mọi thứ.","ipa":["θæŋks","ˈtɛtə","ðæts","ˈɹɪli","ˈhɛlpfəl","aɪl","tɹaɪ","tu","ˌɪmˈpɹuv","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ"],"start":71.224,"end":75.814,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,71.224],[1,71.651],[2,72.497],[3,72.758],[4,73.07],[5,74.086],[6,74.203],[7,74.476],[8,74.646],[9,75.18]]},{"speaker":"teta","en":"Good boy. And you didn't argue once. I'm proud of you.","vi":"Ngoan lắm. Mà cháu chẳng cãi câu nào. Bà tự hào về cháu.","ipa":["ɡʊd","bɔɪ","ənd","ju","ˈdɪdənt","ˈɑɹɡju","wʌns","aɪm","pɹaʊd","ʌv","ju"],"start":76.604,"end":81.534,"expression":"happy","react":{"sami":"shy"},"timing":[[0,76.604],[1,76.776],[2,78.167],[3,78.371],[4,78.479],[5,78.751],[6,79.104],[7,80.612],[8,80.83],[9,81.115],[10,81.197]]}],"words":[{"id":"feedback","en":"feedback","ipa":"ˈfidˌbæk","vi":"phản hồi; ý kiến đóng góp; tiếng hú (loa)","level":3},{"id":"honest","en":"honest","ipa":"ˈɑnəst","vi":"trung thực; thật thà; chân thành","level":2},{"id":"improve","en":"improve","ipa":"ˌɪmˈpɹuv","vi":"cải thiện; tiến bộ","level":1},{"id":"fresh","en":"fresh","ipa":"fɹɛʃ","vi":"tươi; mới; trong lành","level":1},{"id":"suggestion","en":"suggestion","ipa":"səˈdʒɛstʃən","vi":"gợi ý; đề nghị","level":0},{"id":"slightly","en":"slightly","ipa":"ˈslaɪtli","vi":"hơi, một chút; khẽ","level":2}],"focus":{"title":"Góp ý mang tính xây dựng","pattern":"What I liked was… · Maybe you could… · It would be better if… · Have you thought about…? · Next time, try… · Thanks, that's really helpful.","explain":"Góp ý kiểu \"bánh kẹp\": khen trước (\"What I liked was…\"), góp ý nhẹ nhàng ở giữa (\"Maybe you could…\", \"It would be better if + quá khứ đơn…\"), động viên ở cuối. Người nhận đáp lại: \"Thanks, that's really helpful.\" thay vì cãi.","keys":["what i liked was","maybe you could","it would be better if","have you thought about","next time","that's really helpful"],"lines":[3,5,7,9,13,16]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-food-truck.mp3","v":"38bed466c5","duration":82.632,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}